    ["254417"]={"Earth Shield","40码射程","瞬发","6秒冷却时间","|cffffd100Protects the target with an earthen shield, reducing all damage the target receives by 15% and causes the target to be healed for 127 when they take an attack equal to 4% of their total health. 4 Charges.\r\n\r\nEarth Shield can only be placed on one target at a time.|r"},
